GainURL allows to earn money without much advertising, banners and affiliate posts on the pages of your website.

== Description ==

GainURL allows to earn money without much advertising, banners and affiliate posts on the pages of your website. This is an opportunity, which every resource owner dreams about. You can just continue developing your site and get paid for it.

After installing plugin, you need to do minimal setup, and start making money in 5 minutes.

Every time user wants to visit the chosen link, he should enter Google reCaptcha. You will get paid exactly for this entry. For each one that is unique.

You can adjust all kinds of links that will require entering reCaptcha:

* When user clicks on internal or external link (some of them may be excluded from this list);
* When opening a specific link.

Most importantly, you don’t need to add separate links to your posts and pages or to force your users to wade through heaps of banners. You just continue to do your own work, but it will make you a stable income for you.

All you need to do – to sign up on the site and insert API token on the plugin settings page.

Simple terms, simple setting, simple money.

And yes, stop thinking about bots. This is Google reCaptcha, after all ;)

[vimeo https://vimeo.com/179792963]
    
== Installation ==

This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.

In order to use this plugin you will need account on http://gainurl.com/.

= Using The WordPress Dashboard =

1. Navigate to the 'Add New' in the plugins dashboard
2. Search for 'gainurl'
3. Click 'Install Now'
4. Activate the plugin on the Plugin dashboard

= Uploading in WordPress Dashboard =

1. Navigate to the 'Add New' in the plugins dashboard
2. Navigate to the 'Upload' area
3. Select `gainurl.zip` from your computer
4. Click 'Install Now'
5. Activate the plugin in the Plugin dashboard

= Using FTP =

1. Download `gainurl.zip`
2. Extract the `gainurl` directory to your computer
3. Upload the `gainurl` directory to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
4. Activate the plugin in the Plugin dashboard

== Configuration ==

1. Create Account on http://gainurl.com/
2. Go to the tools http://gainurl.com/member/tools/api
3. Copy API Token and paste it to the GainUrl your website in the GainUrl API token field
4. Save settings

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= 1. What is GainURL and how can it help to earn? =

GainURL is a free service, that shortens, protects and monetizes your links.

= 2. What should I know to start using GainURL? =

Nothing! You can start shortening your links from the main page or sign up to monetize by sharing your shortened links just right now.

= 3. How much can I earn by sharing links? =

We pay more than anyone else in our niche, up to 30 dollars for 1000 visits to your shortened link.

= 4. What should I do to earn more? =

Try out our affiliate program on attracting new users. You will receive 20% from their earnings.

= 5. What is the affiliate program? Can I earn more, by attracting new users? =

You can learn detailed information about our referral program in this article: https://gainurl.com/pages/earning-money-from-affiliates

= 6. Which countries does GainURL work in? =

It works in almost every country.

= 7. Will GainURL work with different sites’ engines? =

Of course, you can automate the process of links shortening. There are flexible tools in control panel, and we’ve also developed a WP plugin.

= 8. Do you have plugin? How can I install it on my Wordpress blog? =

There is a detailed instruction in this article: https://gainurl.com/pages/publishers-making-money

= 9. Will malicious ads be displayed? =

We work in partnership with Google. All advertising comes from Google AdWords, that, in turn, provides high-quality filtering.

= 10. Can the recipient of my link distribute it himself? Will I get paid for it? =

You will get paid for any clicks on YOUR links. This article will help you to understand: https://gainurl.com/pages/making-money-by-shortening-links

= 11. Can I get statistics to better understand which links are the most popular among my users? =

All the statistics is available in the control panel of your account.

= 12. How can I get earned money? =

We carry out a withdrawal request within four working days:

* PayPal – up to 100 dollars;
* Bank payment for more than 100 dollars.

= 13. I sent my shortened link 5000 users, but I received only 3500. How to deal with it? =

The visitor of your link won’t generate income for you, if:

* The link was generated not by you but by another/anonymous user;
* The visitor didn’t allow cookies;
* The visitor enabled AdBlock;
* The visitor has changed IP several times recently;
* The visitor has already passed captcha at least 24 hours ago;
* The visitor didn’t pass the captcha.

